        "body": "**Earlier ambiguity.** Older ladder descriptions could attach advancement ambiguously to a person, a host or a component list.\n\n**Current proposal.** The responsible lanista/team owns the earned campaign entry; the animal retains its own historical results; each heat freezes a build. Sale transfers the animal, not the previous lanista’s berth.",
